The mechanism is visible in the option distribution: the mean vector raises the
entropy over the four answer tokens from $0.187$ to $0.972$ nats (maximum
$\ln 4 = 1.386$). A flattened distribution cannot assign any token $-19$ nats,
so it looks excellent on the items where the true state is confidently wrong;
flattening also never promotes a token to the argmax, so accuracy does not move.
The one place the two channels agree is that the \emph{wrong skill} is worst on
both---which is positive evidence for content specificity, since injecting the
wrong content actively misleads.

\paragraph{The same inversion on real skills, for a different reason.}
On the clinical-calculator material the effect lives in a chain of thought, and
two ways of scoring the answer disagree completely. Decoding the full reasoning
and grading it reproduces the behavioural cells almost exactly---on 20 rescued
items, $0.05$ without the skill, $0.05$ with a wrong skill, $0.95$ with the
gold skill. Teacher-forcing the bare answer immediately after the prompt, with
no reasoning in between, gives $-16.27$, $\mathbf{-13.21}$ and $-14.65$ nats
respectively: \emph{the wrong skill scores best}. The likely reason is
mechanical---a correct skill in context makes the model want to start
calculating, so the very next token is less likely to be a digit---but the
consequence is what matters here. Forcing the answer format also destroys the
effect outright: under a \texttt{ANSWER:} cue, accuracy is $0.175$ for
no skill, wrong skill and gold skill alike (40 instances), while the
log-probability still moves by $+0.60$ nats. Any recovery ratio built on that
denominator is a ratio of a channel with no behavioural referent.

We draw a methodological conclusion rather than a correction: on an item set
where the document helps some items and hurts others, an aggregate
log-probability is not a measure of the intervention's fidelity, and neither is
a log-probability measured under an answer format the effect does not survive.
The primary readout must be a count on the rescued cell, decoded the way the
task is actually performed.

\subsection{A band where the forward pass is damaged}

Between layers 17 and 20 every patched condition improves together and the
conditions become indistinguishable. Reading by cell isolates the cause: on the
K cell---items the model already answers correctly---the true-state patch drops
the gold log-probability from $-1.6$ at layer 16 to $-7.1$ at layer 18, while
the filler-state patch, built over an equally long prompt, stays at $-1.5$. Any
transfer or recovery number falling in 17--20 is reported with that band marked.

